<title>SINGAPORE: Pan Pacific Public 1st-hf net up 6.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Pan Pacific Public 1st-hf net up 6.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  1.24  vs   1.16</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	     2.3   vs   2.3</p>
<p>    Turnover			   22.66  vs  22.95</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest   0.24  vs   0.56</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  3.27  vs   3.02</p>
<p>    Interest expense		  0.36  vs   0.31</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation     1.14  vs   1.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    1.77  vs   1.71</p>
<p>    Loss from associates	    0.21  vs   0.29</p>
<p>    Tax				 0.33  vs   0.27</p>
<p>Note - Pan Pacific Public Co Ltd is a publisher.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
